## Infrastructure (CDK)
# infrastructure/bin and infrastructure/lib are CDK *source* folders, not
# .NET build output - un-ignore them from the generic bin/ and obj/ rules
# above, which would otherwise match any directory literally named "bin".
!infrastructure/bin/
!infrastructure/bin/**
!infrastructure/lib/
!infrastructure/lib/**
infrastructure/cdk.out/
infrastructure/cdk-outputs.json
